WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A weight moves on a thread. The hand holding it feels still.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In 1854, Chevreul asked what the movement could actually prove.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Carpenter called attention to movements shaped by suggestion.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Faraday measured which came first: the hands or the table.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
A modern pendulum study found no secret advantage over guessing.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Before believing a promise about your mind, ask how it was tested.
